#Jax Property Intelligence

## Project Goal
Build a Interactive Jacksonville property intelligence platform using pythin,PostgreSQL/PostGIS, SQL, and public GIS data.

## MVP
The application will allow a user to search for Duval County property and view:

-Parcel information
-Property value information
-Sales histroy
-Zoning
-FEMA flood information
-Interactive map

# Core Technology
-Python
-PostgreSQL
-PostGIS
-SQL
-Streamlit
-Github

